     A            BDCOM2    R               REFFLD(NM60) COLHDG('COMMENTS 2')
     A**** BDCOM2 will be substringed as follows:
     A*  Type D9:  Pos. 1-50: display/use on screen/program/file for description
     A*            Pos. 51: Source: P = PMD
     A*                             F = Fee Schedule
     A*                             B = Billed Chrgs
     A*            Pos. 52: "Lesser of" Flag: Y = take lesser of Billed Chrgs
     A*                                           or PMD/FS
     A*                                       blank = no comparison
     A*            Pos. 53-60: not used at this time
     A*  Type DB:  Pos. 1-50: display/use on screen/program/file for description
     A*            Pos. 51: MCA discount flag: Y = Only MCA Claims discounted
     A*                                        blank = no comparison
     A*            Pos. 52-60: not used at this time
     A*
     A*  Type H1:  Pos. 1-1: Minimum Charge meaning
     A*       Valid values:
     A*       *blank = Bill the minimum charge if the calculated fee is
     A*                less than the minimum.
     A*       'X'    = Do NOT bill if the calculated fee is less than
     A*                the minimum.
     A*
     A*  Type P3:  Pos. 1-1: Minimum Charge meaning
     A*       Valid values:
     A*       *blank = Bill the minimum charge if the calculated fee is
     A*                less than the minimum.
     A*       'X'    = Do NOT bill if the calculated fee is less than
     A*                the minimum.
     A*
     A            BDTYPE    R               REFFLD(CODE) COLHDG('TYPE OF RATE' -
     A                                      'OR DISCOUNT')
     A            BDRCDT    R               REFFLD(FLAG) COLHDG('RECORD' +
     A                                      'TYPE' 'B-BILLING,D-DISCOUNT')
     A            BDSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            BDUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            BDPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            BDTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            BDDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A            BDIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER) COLHDG('RECORD' +
     A                                      'CREATED BY')
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 07/10/02 **************************************
     A            BDMRAF    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('TO MRA FLAG')
     A*
     A*           Valid values: 'Y' - Direct reductions to MRA.
     A*                         'N' - Do not Direct reductions to MRA.
     A*
     A            BDOT1F    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('TO OTHER 1 FLAG')
     A*
     A*           Valid values: 'Y' - Direct reductions to Other 1.
     A*                         'N' - Do not Direct reductions to Other 1
     A*
     A            BDOT2F    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('TO OTHER 2 FLAG')
     A*
     A*           Valid values: 'Y' - Direct reductions to Other 2.
     A*                         'N' - Do not Direct reductions to Other 2.
     A*
     A            BDNETF    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('TO NETWORK FLAG')
     A*
     A*           Valid values: 'Y' - Direct reductions to Network.
     A*                         'N' - Do not Direct reductions to Network.
     A*
     A            BDOT1C    R               REFFLD(DS3)
     A                                      COLHDG('TO OTHER 1 CODE')
     A*
     A*           Valid values: FTBSP via type "O"
     A*
     A            BDOT2C    R               REFFLD(DS3)
     A                                      COLHDG('TO OTHER 2 CODE')
     A*
     A*           Valid values: FTBSP via type "O"
     A*
     A*** END   ADD *** 07/10/02 **************************************
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 10/24/02 **************************************
     A            BDLMRA    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('LEAVE MRA FLAG')
     A*
     A*           Valid values: 'Y' - Don't touch the MRA amount.
     A*                         'N' - Clear the MRA amount.
     A*
     A*** END   ADD *** 10/24/02 **************************************
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 10/20/03 **************************************
     A            BDSKPD    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('SKIP IF LINE IS' +
     A                                      'DENIED')
     A*
     A*           Valid values: 'Y' - Skip line if denied.
     A*                         ' ' - Don't skip if denied.
     A*
     A*** END   ADD *** 10/20/03 **************************************
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 03/21/05 **************************************
     A            BDMADG    R               REFFLD(DS3)
     A                                      COLHDG('MADIGAN RATE CODE')
     A*
     A*           Valid values: NMBDP DK CODES
     A*** END   ADD *** 03/21/05 **************************************
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 04/08/11 **************************************
     A            BDCOM3    R               REFFLD(NM60) COLHDG('COMMENTS 3')
     A*** END   ADD *** 04/08/11 **************************************
